  partName: Rear Blade Shroud 1
  description: The Rear Blade Shroud 1 is a thin, flat component positioned at the
    middle-center-rear of the engine, made from Blades2 material. It serves as a
    protective casing for the Rear Blade 1, shielding it from the surrounding environment
    and facilitating smooth airflow. Interestingly, its thin design allows for minimal
    obstruction of the airflow, maximizing the engine's overall efficiency.
